OL,3,GNEWSAFather's crash death leaves 'huge
OL,4,Avoid' for family
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father-of-two who died in a crash at
OL,7,Fthe weekend could light up a room with
OL,8,Fhis "cheeky smile", his family has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FRyan Scarth, 31, of Sherburn Village,
OL,12,FCounty Durham, died at the scene of a
OL,13,Fcrash on the A1(M) near Durham at about
OL,14,F02:20 BST on Saturday.
OL,16,FHis family said his death had "truly
OL,17,Fbroken us" and had left a "huge void"
OL,18,Fin their lives and the community.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
